# AgenticApp SDD build

When implementing the agentic app, **do not** follow `submission/prompts/11_product_and_build.md`.

Follow, in order:

1. `submission/AgenticApp/09_sdd_build/BUILD_SDD.md` (constitution)
2. The current task in `submission/AgenticApp/09_sdd_build/TASK_INDEX.md`
3. Only the spec paths that task lists (under `submission/AgenticApp/`)

Implement product code in `submission/aegis-sdd/` (SDLC scaffold). Keep `submission/src`, `app`, `tests` as scoring shims. Unskip AC tests as the module lands. Assessment mode must pass without Azure packages. Workflow name is `supply_options`. Do not `git init` inside `aegis-sdd` unless asked.
